{"id":"0a7ed5215db80540","group":"92","path":"92/92-ex-ackermann-not-pr.md","title":"Ackermann Function Not PR","display":"ex-ackermann-not-pr — Ackermann Function Not PR","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-ex-ackermann-not-pr","aliases":["92-ex-ackermann-not-pr"],"display":"ex-ackermann-not-pr — Ackermann Function Not PR","depends_on":["[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[92-df-recursive-function]]"],"source":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义","source_status":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ex-ackermann-not-pr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ex-ackermann-not-pr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-ackermann-not-pr — Ackermann Function Not PR"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ack} : \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ack} : \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (Ackermann function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> (total-recursive function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}ackermann\\text{-}not\\text{-}pr} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Ack}(0,n)=n+1)\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Ack}(m+1,0)=\\mathrm{Ack}(m,1))\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Ack}(m+1,n+1)=\\mathrm{Ack}(m,\\mathrm{Ack}(m+1,n)))\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(\\mathrm{Ack})\\land\\mathrm{Ack}\\notin\\mathrm{PR}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}ackermann\\text{-}not\\text{-}pr} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Ack}(0,n)=n+1)\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Ack}(m+1,0)=\\mathrm{Ack}(m,1))\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Ack}(m+1,n+1)=\\mathrm{Ack}(m,\\mathrm{Ack}(m+1,n)))\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(\\mathrm{Ack})\\land\\mathrm{Ack}\\notin\\mathrm{PR}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ackermann函数是递归的但不是原始递归的</li>\n<li>对每个一元 PR 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，对角函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\mapsto\\mathrm{Ack}(n,n)\">\\(n\\mapsto\\mathrm{Ack}(n,n)\\)</span> 最终支配 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>；这里必须固定一元类型并使用“最终支配”，而非无类型地说超过所有 PR 函数</li>\n<li>其增长不能由任意固定高度的指数塔准确概括</li>\n<li>Ackermann函数说明μ运算比PR运算更强</li>\n<li>递归 = PR + μ运算严格扩张PR</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (total-recursive function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ack} : \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}ackermann\\text{-}not\\text{-}pr} \\vdash \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Ack}(0,n)=n+1)\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Ack}(m+1,0)=\\mathrm{Ack}(m,1))\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{Ack}(m+1,n+1)=\\mathrm{Ack}(m,\\mathrm{Ack}(m+1,n)))\\land\\mathrm{Rec}(\\mathrm{Ack})\\land\\mathrm{Ack}\\notin\\mathrm{PR}","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"n\\mapsto\\mathrm{Ack}(n,n)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1630,"backlinks":[{"id":"ac4388db49632759","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这里 TMComp 在总函数上使用与 [[92-prop-rec-equal-tm]] 同一固定机器模型。PR⊆Rec 后由该模型等价得到 PR⊆TM；Ack 的可计算性与非 PR 需要 [[92-ex-ackermann-not-pr]] 的独立论证。原书未展开 Ackermann 比较，不把这一例当作其章节结论。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-376","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-ex-ackermann-not-pr]]"}],"outgoing":["8bff810dd710385a","d65795dc15ebce4b"]}